\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Omnipotent Redeemer,
\par Our ransomed souls adore Thee;
\par Whate'er is done
\par Thy work we own,
\par And give Thee all the glory;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par With thankfulness acknowledge
\par Our time of visitation;
\par Thine hand confess,
\par And gladly bless 
\par The God of our salvation.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2 Thou hast employed Thy servants,
\par And blessed their work endeavours,
\par And lo, in Thee
\par We myriads see
\par Of justified believers;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par The church of pardoned sinners,
\par Sing all day long
\par The gospel song, 
\par And triumph in Thy favour.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3Thy wonders wrought already 
\par Require our ceaseless praises;
\par But show Thy power,
\par And myriads more
\par Endue with heavenly graces.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par But fill our earth with glory,
\par And, known by every nation,
\par God of all grace
\par Receive the praise
\par Of all Thy new creation.\tab 
\par Amen
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

